{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"歐聯精華｜皇馬5比1反勝燕豪芬／曼城及阿仙奴分途出擊和波收場\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CL-HL-261125.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月25日歐聯賽事精華：</p><p>皇家馬德里 5:1 燕豪芬</p><p>曼城 2:2 拿玻里</p><p>阿仙奴 1:1 多蒙特</p><p>其他賽果：</p><p>加拉塔沙雷 1:0 阿士東維拉</p><p>科木 1:0 AEK雅典</p><p>萊比錫 3:1 朗斯</p><p>飛燕諾 0:1 波圖</p><p>布拉迪斯拉發斯拉夫人 0:2 貝迪斯</p><p>博德基林 1:0 連斯體育會</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:23:52.610220+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T05:37:36.928233+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T00:17:25.390743+00:00","content_hash":"76d609e86d5735c242fa15092dd73be2f6bf361889b993576d22b3de069275d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}